# ── Design artefacts — excluded per Session 4 approval ───────────────────────
# DELIBERATE DEVIATION FROM SPEC.md §0:
# §0 states that design/mock/ sketches should be committed as an approval
# artefact before UI work begins (the workflow is: requirements → sketches in
# design/mock/ → agent reviews → user approves → UI code written).
# Excluding design/ entirely means mock sketches are local-only rather than
# committed gate artefacts. This is a known, approved exception: the approval
# gate remains enforced by conversation discipline (the agent will not build
# UI without seeing mocks), but the mocks themselves are not tracked in git.
design/

